---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import Cover from '../img/poster2.jpg';
---

<div class="bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-900 to-gray-700">
  <section class="sm:pt-72 pt-48 pb-0 sm:pb-24 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div id="synopsis" class="container mx-auto px-4 flex flex-col flex-col-reverse md:flex-row items-center">
      <div class="w-full md:w-1/3 mb-8 md:mb-0" data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-duration="1000">
        <Image src={Cover} alt="Red Storm Rising Movie Cover" class="rounded-2xl shadow-2xl">
      </div>
      <div class="w-full md:w-2/3 mb-12 md:mb-0 md:pl-12 sm:text-justify">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-red-600 mb-2" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="800">Red Storm Rising</h2>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="800" data-aos-delay="100">Unmasking the Battle for America’s Soul</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-100 mb-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="800" data-aos-delay="300">For over a century, socialism has quietly but steadily infiltrated America, reshaping its institutions and values. Red Storm Rising uncovers this ideological takeover, exposing how education, family, religion, government, and media have become battlegrounds in a larger fight for the nation’s future.

</p>
        <p class="text-gray-100 mb-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="800" data-aos-delay="400">Follow Josh Hicks, a recent college graduate, on a transformative journey to uncover the truth about America’s founding principles. As he travels the country, Josh meets fearless patriots—educators, leaders, families, and everyday citizens—who are standing up against the forces seeking to rewrite history and dismantle freedom.

</p>
        <p class="text-gray-100 mb-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="800" data-aos-delay="500">From classrooms to congregations, from the halls of government to the heart of American families, Red Storm Rising explores the courageous stories of those defending liberty and faith against an encroaching tide. This documentary is a call to action, a testament to resilience, and a powerful reminder of what’s at stake in America’s fight to remain true to its foundational ideals.

</p>
        <p class="text-gray-100 mb-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="800" data-aos-delay="500">Prepare to be informed, inspired, and empowered to join the charge to preserve America’s freedom. The storm is rising—will you stand against it?

</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
